face radio: not_packed radio.v1/@stream/frames: a crossing resource whose type is not packed: its contract does not list link.v2, so it crosses as link.v1 says, at its unpacked size (link.v2 §2.17)
face radio: not_packed radio.v1/events/fault: a crossing resource whose type is not packed: its contract does not list link.v2, so it crosses as link.v1 says, at its unpacked size (link.v2 §2.17)
